{"number":87,"nameArabic":"الأعلى","nameTransliterated":"Al-A'la","nameTranslated":"The Most High","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":19,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"87:1","textAr":"سَبِّحِ ٱسۡمَ رَبِّكَ ٱلۡأَعۡلَى","transliteration":"Sabbihi isma rabbika alaAAla","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Exalt the name of your Lord, the Most High"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"(اے نبیؐ) اپنے رب برتر کے نام کی تسبیح کرو"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"87:2","textAr":"ٱلَّذِي خَلَقَ فَسَوَّىٰ","transliteration":"Allathee khalaqa fasawwa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Who created and proportioned"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جس نے پیدا کیا اور تناسب قائم کیا"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"87:3","textAr":"وَٱلَّذِي قَدَّرَ فَهَدَىٰ","transliteration":"Waallathee qaddara fahada","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And who destined and [then] guided"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جس نے تقدیر بنائی پھر راہ دکھائی"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"87:4","textAr":"وَٱلَّذِيٓ أَخۡرَجَ ٱلۡمَرۡعَىٰ","transliteration":"Waallathee akhraja almarAAa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And who brings out the pasture"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جس نے نباتات اگائیں"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"87:5","textAr":"فَجَعَلَهُۥ غُثَآءً أَحۡوَىٰ","transliteration":"FajaAAalahu ghuthaan ahwa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And [then] makes it black stubble"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر اُن کو سیاہ کوڑا کرکٹ بنا دیا"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"87:6","textAr":"سَنُقۡرِئُكَ فَلَا تَنسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Sanuqrioka fala tansa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"We will make you recite, [O Muhammad], and you will not forget"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہم تمہیں پڑھوا دیں گے، پھر تم نہیں بھولو گے"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"87:7","textAr":"إِلَّا مَا شَآءَ ٱللَّهُۚ إِنَّهُۥ يَعۡلَمُ ٱلۡجَهۡرَ وَمَا يَخۡفَىٰ","transliteration":"Illa ma shaa Allahu innahu yaAAlamu aljahra wama yakhfa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Except what Allah should will. Indeed, He knows what is declared and what is hidden"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"سوائے اُس کے جو اللہ چاہے، وہ ظاہر کو بھی جانتا ہے اور جو کچھ پوشیدہ ہے اُس کو بھی"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"87:8","textAr":"وَنُيَسِّرُكَ لِلۡيُسۡرَىٰ","transliteration":"Wanuyassiruka lilyusra","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And We will ease you toward ease"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور ہم تمہیں آسان طریقے کی سہولت دیتے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":9,"verseKey":"87:9","textAr":"فَذَكِّرۡ إِن نَّفَعَتِ ٱلذِّكۡرَىٰ","transliteration":"Fathakkir in nafaAAati alththikra","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So remind, if the reminder should benefit"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"لہٰذا تم نصیحت کرو اگر نصیحت نافع ہو"}]},{"ayah":10,"verseKey":"87:10","textAr":"سَيَذَّكَّرُ مَن يَخۡشَىٰ","transliteration":"Sayaththakkaru man yakhsha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"He who fears [Allah] will be reminded"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جو شخص ڈرتا ہے وہ نصیحت قبول کر لے گا"}]},{"ayah":11,"verseKey":"87:11","textAr":"وَيَتَجَنَّبُهَا ٱلۡأَشۡقَى","transliteration":"Wayatajannabuha alashqa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But the wretched one will avoid it"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اس سے گریز کریگا وہ انتہائی بد بخت"}]},{"ayah":12,"verseKey":"87:12","textAr":"ٱلَّذِي يَصۡلَى ٱلنَّارَ ٱلۡكُبۡرَىٰ","transliteration":"Allathee yasla alnnara alkubra","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[He] who will [enter and] burn in the greatest Fire"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جو بڑی آگ میں جائے گا"}]},{"ayah":13,"verseKey":"87:13","textAr":"ثُمَّ لَا يَمُوتُ فِيهَا وَلَا يَحۡيَىٰ","transliteration":"Thumma la yamootu feeha wala yahya","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Neither dying therein nor living"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر نہ اس میں مرے گا نہ جیے گا"}]},{"ayah":14,"verseKey":"87:14","textAr":"قَدۡ أَفۡلَحَ مَن تَزَكَّىٰ","transliteration":"Qad aflaha man tazakka","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"He has certainly succeeded who purifies himself"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"فلاح پا گیا وہ جس نے پاکیزگی اختیار کی"}]},{"ayah":15,"verseKey":"87:15","textAr":"وَذَكَرَ ٱسۡمَ رَبِّهِۦ فَصَلَّىٰ","transliteration":"Wathakara isma rabbihi fasalla","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And mentions the name of his Lord and prays"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اپنے رب کا نام یاد کیا پھر نماز پڑھی"}]},{"ayah":16,"verseKey":"87:16","textAr":"بَلۡ تُؤۡثِرُونَ ٱلۡحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنۡيَا","transliteration":"Bal tuthiroona alhayata alddunya","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But you prefer the worldly life"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"مگر تم لوگ دنیا کی زندگی کو ترجیح دیتے ہو"}]},{"ayah":17,"verseKey":"87:17","textAr":"وَٱلۡأٓخِرَةُ خَيۡرٞ وَأَبۡقَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Waalakhiratu khayrun waabqa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"While the Hereafter is better and more enduring"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"حالانکہ آخرت بہتر ہے اور باقی رہنے والی ہے"}]},{"ayah":18,"verseKey":"87:18","textAr":"إِنَّ هَٰذَا لَفِي ٱلصُّحُفِ ٱلۡأُولَىٰ","transliteration":"Inna hatha lafee alssuhufi aloola","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, this is in the former scriptures"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہی بات پہلے آئے ہوئے صحیفوں میں بھی کہی گئی تھی"}]},{"ayah":19,"verseKey":"87:19","textAr":"صُحُفِ إِبۡرَٰهِيمَ وَمُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"Suhufi ibraheema wamoosa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"The scriptures of Abraham and Moses"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ابراہیمؑ اور موسیٰؑ کے صحیفوں میں"}]}]}